#:: ''It '''will have to''' wait.''
# (''as an auxiliary verb'') [[may]], [[can]], [[be allowed]]
#: ''Pasienten '''får''' ikkje ta imot besøk.''
#:: ''The pasient is not '''allowed to''' have visits.''
