===Adjective===
{{sv-adj|färre|([[färst]])}}

# [[few]]

====Antonyms====
* [[många]]

=====Usage notes=====
The superlative form {{term|färst|lang=sv}} is extremely rare and was considered extinct for the whole 20th century. Usually, “''minst''” is used, or, when used as a noun, a rewording on the lines of “det [[minsta]] [[antal]]et” (literally: “the least number of”, or “the smallest number of”) is done.

===Verb===
{{infl|sv|verb}}

# [[get]], [[receive]]
#: ''Jag '''fick''' paketet idag.''
#:: ''I '''received''' the package today.''
#: ''Han '''fick''' ett Xbox i julklapp.''
#:: ''He '''got''' an Xbox for christmas.''
# be [[allowed]] to; [[may]]
#: ''Du '''får''' ta så många du vill.''
#:: ''You '''may''' take as many as you want.''
# cause to happen; [[get]]
#: '''''Få''' ut honom därifrån!''
#:: '''''Get''' him out of there!''

